NAME
    gcloud compute composite-health-checks - manage composite health checks

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud compute composite-health-checks COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Manage composite health checks.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        Create a composite health check.

     delete
        Delete a composite health check.

     describe
        Describe a composite health check.

     get-health
        Get health status of a composite health check.

     list
        List composite health checks.

     update
        Update a composite health check.

NOTES
    These variants are also available:

        $ gcloud alpha compute composite-health-checks

        $ gcloud beta compute composite-health-checks

